Third-party components

This project is a standalone client application: it communicates with an
Apache Airflow instance over HTTP (stable REST API v1 and documented
internal web endpoints) and does NOT include, copy, or link any Apache
Airflow source code or assets.

Runtime and build dependencies are listed in package.json and are
distributed under their own permissive licenses (MIT / BSD / ISC /
Apache-2.0 — see each package's license in node_modules). Notable ones:

